OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's laureates to donate to
OL,4,ASally Rooney after UK sales halted over
OL,5,APalestine Action support
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe children's laureates for Wales and
OL,8,FIreland are to give their book
OL,9,Froyalties to Sally Rooney after she
OL,10,Fhalted UK sales because of her support
OL,11,Ffor Palestine Action.
OL,13,FNicola Davies and her Irish counterpart
OL,14,FChris Haughton made the decision after
OL,15,Fshe stopped supplying her novels to
OL,16,Fbooksellers in the UK because of fears
OL,17,Fher work could constitute a "serious
OL,18,Fcriminal offence".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
