OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's laureates to donate to
OL,4,ASally Rooney after UK sales halted over
OL,5,APalestine Action support
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Normal People author said in 2025
OL,8,Fshe intended to carry on using her
OL,9,Froyalties to support the group, despite
OL,10,Fit being a proscribed a terrorist
OL,11,Forganisation in the UK.
OL,13,FDavies said: "I don't think I can say
OL,14,FI'm standing up for children in Wales
OL,15,Fwithout standing up for children in
OL,16,FPalestine."
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
